{"bookId":"habakkuk","version":"kjv-strong","source":"eBible KJV2006 USFM","chapters":{"1":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"The burden which Habakkuk the prophet did see.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"burden","strongs":["H4853"]},{"text":"which"},{"text":"Habakkuk","strongs":["H2265"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"prophet","strongs":["H5030"]},{"text":"did"},{"text":"see","strongs":["H2372"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":2,"text":"O LORD, how long shall I cry, and thou wilt not hear! even cry out unto thee of violence, and thou wilt not save!","tokens":[{"text":"O"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", how long shall I"},{"text":"cry","strongs":["H7768"]},{"text":", and thou wilt not"},{"text":"hear","strongs":["H8085"]},{"text":"! even cry"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H2199"]},{"text":"unto thee of"},{"text":"violence","strongs":["H2555"]},{"text":", and thou wilt not"},{"text":"save","strongs":["H3467"]},{"text":"!"}]},{"number":3,"text":"Why dost thou shew me iniquity, and cause me to behold grievance? for spoiling and violence are before me: and there are that raise up strife and contention.","tokens":[{"text":"Why dost thou"},{"text":"shew","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"me"},{"text":"iniquity","strongs":["H0205"]},{"text":", and cause me to"},{"text":"behold","strongs":["H5027"]},{"text":"grievance","strongs":["H5999"]},{"text":"? for"},{"text":"spoiling","strongs":["H7701"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"violence","strongs":["H2555"]},{"text":"are before me: and there are that raise"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":"strife","strongs":["H7379"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"contention","strongs":["H4066"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"Therefore the law is slacked, and judgment doth never go forth: for the wicked doth compass about the righteous; therefore wrong judgment proceedeth.","tokens":[{"text":"Therefore the"},{"text":"law","strongs":["H8451"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"slacked","strongs":["H6313"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"judgment","strongs":["H4941"]},{"text":"doth"},{"text":"never","strongs":["H5331"]},{"text":"go"},{"text":"forth","strongs":["H3318"]},{"text":": for the"},{"text":"wicked","strongs":["H7563"]},{"text":"doth"},{"text":"compass","strongs":["H3803"]},{"text":"about the"},{"text":"righteous","strongs":["H6662"]},{"text":"; therefore"},{"text":"wrong","strongs":["H6127"]},{"text":"judgment","strongs":["H4941"]},{"text":"proceedeth","strongs":["H3318"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"Behold ye among the heathen, and regard, and wonder marvellously: for I will work a work in your days, which ye will not believe, though it be told you.","tokens":[{"text":"Behold","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"ye among the"},{"text":"heathen","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"regard","strongs":["H5027"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"wonder","strongs":["H8539"]},{"text":"marvellously","strongs":["H8539"]},{"text":": for I will"},{"text":"work","strongs":["H6466"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"work","strongs":["H6467"]},{"text":"in your"},{"text":"days","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":", which ye will not"},{"text":"believe","strongs":["H0539"]},{"text":", though it be"},{"text":"told","strongs":["H5608"]},{"text":"you."}]},{"number":6,"text":"For, lo, I raise up the Chaldeans, that bitter and hasty nation, which shall march through the breadth of the land, to possess the dwellingplaces that are not theirs.","tokens":[{"text":"For, lo, I raise"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H6965"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"Chaldeans","strongs":["H3778"]},{"text":", that"},{"text":"bitter","strongs":["H4751"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"hasty","strongs":["H4116"]},{"text":"nation","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":", which shall"},{"text":"march","strongs":["H1980"]},{"text":"through the"},{"text":"breadth","strongs":["H4800"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":", to"},{"text":"possess","strongs":["H3423"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"dwellingplaces","strongs":["H4908"]},{"text":"that are not theirs."}]},{"number":7,"text":"They are terrible and dreadful: their judgment and their dignity shall proceed of themselves.","tokens":[{"text":"They are"},{"text":"terrible","strongs":["H0366"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"dreadful","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":": their"},{"text":"judgment","strongs":["H4941"]},{"text":"and their"},{"text":"dignity","strongs":["H7613"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"proceed","strongs":["H3318"]},{"text":"of themselves."}]},{"number":8,"text":"Their horses also are swifter than the leopards, and are more fierce than the evening wolves: and their horsemen shall spread themselves, and their horsemen shall come from far; they shall fly as the eagle that hasteth to eat.","tokens":[{"text":"Their"},{"text":"horses","strongs":["H5483"]},{"text":"also are"},{"text":"swifter","strongs":["H7043"]},{"text":"than the"},{"text":"leopards","strongs":["H5246"]},{"text":", and are more"},{"text":"fierce","strongs":["H2300"]},{"text":"than the"},{"text":"evening","strongs":["H6153"]},{"text":"wolves","strongs":["H2061"]},{"text":": and their"},{"text":"horsemen","strongs":["H6571"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"spread","strongs":["H6335"]},{"text":"themselves, and their"},{"text":"horsemen","strongs":["H6571"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"come","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"from"},{"text":"far","strongs":["H7350"]},{"text":"; they shall"},{"text":"fly","strongs":["H5774"]},{"text":"as the"},{"text":"eagle","strongs":["H5404"]},{"text":"that"},{"text":"hasteth","strongs":["H2363"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"eat","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"They shall come all for violence: their faces shall sup up as the east wind, and they shall gather the captivity as the sand.","tokens":[{"text":"They shall"},{"text":"come","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"all for"},{"text":"violence","strongs":["H2555"]},{"text":": their"},{"text":"faces","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"shall sup"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H4041"]},{"text":"as the east"},{"text":"wind","strongs":["H6921"]},{"text":", and they shall"},{"text":"gather","strongs":["H0622"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"captivity","strongs":["H7628"]},{"text":"as the"},{"text":"sand","strongs":["H2344"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"And they shall scoff at the kings, and the princes shall be a scorn unto them: they shall deride every strong hold; for they shall heap dust, and take it.","tokens":[{"text":"And they shall"},{"text":"scoff","strongs":["H7046"]},{"text":"at the"},{"text":"kings","strongs":["H4428"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"princes","strongs":["H7336"]},{"text":"shall be a"},{"text":"scorn","strongs":["H4890"]},{"text":"unto them: they shall"},{"text":"deride","strongs":["H7832"]},{"text":"every strong"},{"text":"hold","strongs":["H4013"]},{"text":"; for they shall"},{"text":"heap","strongs":["H6651"]},{"text":"dust","strongs":["H6083"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"take","strongs":["H3920"]},{"text":"it."}]},{"number":11,"text":"Then shall his mind change, and he shall pass over, and offend, imputing this his power unto his god.","tokens":[{"text":"Then shall his"},{"text":"mind","strongs":["H7307"]},{"text":"change","strongs":["H2498"]},{"text":", and he shall pass"},{"text":"over","strongs":["H5674"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"offend","strongs":["H0816"]},{"text":", imputing"},{"text":"this","strongs":["H2098"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"power","strongs":["H3581"]},{"text":"unto his"},{"text":"god","strongs":["H0433"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"Art thou not from everlasting, O LORD my God, mine Holy One? we shall not die. O LORD, thou hast ordained them for judgment; and, O mighty God, thou hast established them for correction.","tokens":[{"text":"Art thou not from"},{"text":"everlasting","strongs":["H6924"]},{"text":", O"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":", mine Holy"},{"text":"One","strongs":["H6918"]},{"text":"? we shall not"},{"text":"die","strongs":["H4191"]},{"text":". O"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", thou hast"},{"text":"ordained","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"them for"},{"text":"judgment","strongs":["H4941"]},{"text":"; and, O mighty"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H6697"]},{"text":", thou hast"},{"text":"established","strongs":["H3245"]},{"text":"them for"},{"text":"correction","strongs":["H3198"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"Thou art of purer eyes than to behold evil, and canst not look on iniquity: wherefore lookest thou upon them that deal treacherously, and holdest thy tongue when the wicked devoureth the man that is more righteous than he?","tokens":[{"text":"Thou art of"},{"text":"purer","strongs":["H2889"]},{"text":"eyes","strongs":["H5869"]},{"text":"than to"},{"text":"behold","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"canst","strongs":["H3201"]},{"text":"not"},{"text":"look","strongs":["H5027"]},{"text":"on"},{"text":"iniquity","strongs":["H5999"]},{"text":": wherefore"},{"text":"lookest","strongs":["H5027"]},{"text":"thou upon them that deal"},{"text":"treacherously","strongs":["H0898"]},{"text":", and holdest thy"},{"text":"tongue","strongs":["H2790"]},{"text":"when the"},{"text":"wicked","strongs":["H7563"]},{"text":"devoureth","strongs":["H1104"]},{"text":"the man that is more"},{"text":"righteous","strongs":["H6662"]},{"text":"than he?"}]},{"number":14,"text":"And makest men as the fishes of the sea, as the creeping things, that have no ruler over them?","tokens":[{"text":"And"},{"text":"makest","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"men","strongs":["H0120"]},{"text":"as the"},{"text":"fishes","strongs":["H1709"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":", as the creeping"},{"text":"things","strongs":["H7431"]},{"text":", that have no"},{"text":"ruler","strongs":["H4910"]},{"text":"over them?"}]},{"number":15,"text":"They take up all of them with the angle, they catch them in their net, and gather them in their drag: therefore they rejoice and are glad.","tokens":[{"text":"They take"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5927"]},{"text":"all of them with the"},{"text":"angle","strongs":["H2443"]},{"text":", they"},{"text":"catch","strongs":["H1641"]},{"text":"them in their"},{"text":"net","strongs":["H2764"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"gather","strongs":["H0622"]},{"text":"them in their"},{"text":"drag","strongs":["H4365"]},{"text":": therefore they"},{"text":"rejoice","strongs":["H8055"]},{"text":"and are"},{"text":"glad","strongs":["H1523"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":16,"text":"Therefore they sacrifice unto their net, and burn incense unto their drag; because by them their portion is fat, and their meat plenteous.","tokens":[{"text":"Therefore they"},{"text":"sacrifice","strongs":["H2076"]},{"text":"unto their"},{"text":"net","strongs":["H2764"]},{"text":", and burn"},{"text":"incense","strongs":["H6999"]},{"text":"unto their"},{"text":"drag","strongs":["H4365"]},{"text":"; because by"},{"text":"them","strongs":["H1992"]},{"text":"their"},{"text":"portion","strongs":["H2506"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"fat","strongs":["H8082"]},{"text":", and their"},{"text":"meat","strongs":["H3978"]},{"text":"plenteous","strongs":["H1277"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":17,"text":"Shall they therefore empty their net, and not spare continually to slay the nations?","tokens":[{"text":"Shall they therefore"},{"text":"empty","strongs":["H7324"]},{"text":"their"},{"text":"net","strongs":["H2764"]},{"text":", and not"},{"text":"spare","strongs":["H2550"]},{"text":"continually","strongs":["H8548"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"slay","strongs":["H2026"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"nations","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"?"}]}]},"2":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"I will stand upon my watch, and set me upon the tower, and will watch to see what he will say unto me, and what I shall answer when I am reproved.","tokens":[{"text":"I will"},{"text":"stand","strongs":["H5975"]},{"text":"upon my"},{"text":"watch","strongs":["H4931"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"set","strongs":["H3320"]},{"text":"me upon the"},{"text":"tower","strongs":["H4692"]},{"text":", and will"},{"text":"watch","strongs":["H6822"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"see","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"what he will"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H1696"]},{"text":"unto me, and what I shall"},{"text":"answer","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"when I am"},{"text":"reproved","strongs":["H8433"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":2,"text":"And the LORD answered me, and said, Write the vision, and make it plain upon tables, that he may run that readeth it.","tokens":[{"text":"And the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"answered","strongs":["H6030"]},{"text":"me, and"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":","},{"text":"Write","strongs":["H3789"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"vision","strongs":["H2377"]},{"text":", and make it"},{"text":"plain","strongs":["H0874"]},{"text":"upon"},{"text":"tables","strongs":["H3871"]},{"text":", that he may"},{"text":"run","strongs":["H7323"]},{"text":"that"},{"text":"readeth","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"it."}]},{"number":3,"text":"For the vision is yet for an appointed time, but at the end it shall speak, and not lie: though it tarry, wait for it; because it will surely come, it will not tarry.","tokens":[{"text":"For the"},{"text":"vision","strongs":["H2377"]},{"text":"is yet for an appointed"},{"text":"time","strongs":["H4150"]},{"text":", but at the"},{"text":"end","strongs":["H7093"]},{"text":"it shall"},{"text":"speak","strongs":["H6315"]},{"text":", and not"},{"text":"lie","strongs":["H3576"]},{"text":": though it"},{"text":"tarry","strongs":["H4102"]},{"text":","},{"text":"wait","strongs":["H2442"]},{"text":"for it; because it will"},{"text":"surely","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"come","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":", it will not"},{"text":"tarry","strongs":["H0309"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"Behold, his soul which is lifted up is not upright in him: but the just shall live by his faith.","tokens":[{"text":"Behold, his"},{"text":"soul","strongs":["H5315"]},{"text":"which is lifted"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H6075"]},{"text":"is not"},{"text":"upright","strongs":["H3474"]},{"text":"in him: but the"},{"text":"just","strongs":["H6662"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"live","strongs":["H2421"]},{"text":"by his"},{"text":"faith","strongs":["H0530"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"Yea also, because he transgresseth by wine, he is a proud man, neither keepeth at home, who enlargeth his desire as hell, and is as death, and cannot be satisfied, but gathereth unto him all nations, and heapeth unto him all people:","tokens":[{"text":"Yea also, because he"},{"text":"transgresseth","strongs":["H0898"]},{"text":"by"},{"text":"wine","strongs":["H3196"]},{"text":", he is a"},{"text":"proud","strongs":["H3093"]},{"text":"man","strongs":["H1397"]},{"text":", neither keepeth at"},{"text":"home","strongs":["H5115"]},{"text":", who"},{"text":"enlargeth","strongs":["H7337"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"desire","strongs":["H5315"]},{"text":"as"},{"text":"hell","strongs":["H7585"]},{"text":", and is as"},{"text":"death","strongs":["H4194"]},{"text":", and cannot be"},{"text":"satisfied","strongs":["H7646"]},{"text":", but"},{"text":"gathereth","strongs":["H0622"]},{"text":"unto him all"},{"text":"nations","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"heapeth","strongs":["H6908"]},{"text":"unto him all"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":":"}]},{"number":6,"text":"Shall not all these take up a parable against him, and a taunting proverb against him, and say, Woe to him that increaseth that which is not his! how long? and to him that ladeth himself with thick clay!","tokens":[{"text":"Shall not all these take"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"parable","strongs":["H4912"]},{"text":"against him, and a"},{"text":"taunting","strongs":["H4426"]},{"text":"proverb","strongs":["H2420"]},{"text":"against him, and"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":","},{"text":"Woe","strongs":["H1945"]},{"text":"to him that"},{"text":"increaseth","strongs":["H7235"]},{"text":"that which is not his! how long? and to him that"},{"text":"ladeth","strongs":["H3513"]},{"text":"himself with thick"},{"text":"clay","strongs":["H5671"]},{"text":"!"}]},{"number":7,"text":"Shall they not rise up suddenly that shall bite thee, and awake that shall vex thee, and thou shalt be for booties unto them?","tokens":[{"text":"Shall they not rise"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H6965"]},{"text":"suddenly","strongs":["H6621"]},{"text":"that shall"},{"text":"bite","strongs":["H5391"]},{"text":"thee, and"},{"text":"awake","strongs":["H3364"]},{"text":"that shall"},{"text":"vex","strongs":["H2111"]},{"text":"thee, and thou shalt be for"},{"text":"booties","strongs":["H4933"]},{"text":"unto them?"}]},{"number":8,"text":"Because thou hast spoiled many nations, all the remnant of the people shall spoil thee; because of men’s blood, and for the violence of the land, of the city, and of all that dwell therein.","tokens":[{"text":"Because thou hast"},{"text":"spoiled","strongs":["H7997"]},{"text":"many","strongs":["H7227"]},{"text":"nations","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":", all the"},{"text":"remnant","strongs":["H3499"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"spoil","strongs":["H7997"]},{"text":"thee; because of"},{"text":"men’s","strongs":["H0120"]},{"text":"blood","strongs":["H1818"]},{"text":", and for the"},{"text":"violence","strongs":["H2555"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":", of the"},{"text":"city","strongs":["H7151"]},{"text":", and of all that"},{"text":"dwell","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"therein."}]},{"number":9,"text":"Woe to him that coveteth an evil covetousness to his house, that he may set his nest on high, that he may be delivered from the power of evil!","tokens":[{"text":"Woe","strongs":["H1945"]},{"text":"to him that"},{"text":"coveteth","strongs":["H1214"]},{"text":"an"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"covetousness","strongs":["H1215"]},{"text":"to his"},{"text":"house","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":", that he may"},{"text":"set","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"nest","strongs":["H7064"]},{"text":"on"},{"text":"high","strongs":["H4791"]},{"text":", that he may be"},{"text":"delivered","strongs":["H5337"]},{"text":"from the"},{"text":"power","strongs":["H3709"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"!"}]},{"number":10,"text":"Thou hast consulted shame to thy house by cutting off many people, and hast sinned against thy soul.","tokens":[{"text":"Thou hast"},{"text":"consulted","strongs":["H3289"]},{"text":"shame","strongs":["H1322"]},{"text":"to thy"},{"text":"house","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"by cutting"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H7096"]},{"text":"many","strongs":["H7227"]},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":", and hast"},{"text":"sinned","strongs":["H2398"]},{"text":"against thy"},{"text":"soul","strongs":["H5315"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":11,"text":"For the stone shall cry out of the wall, and the beam out of the timber shall answer it.","tokens":[{"text":"For the"},{"text":"stone","strongs":["H0068"]},{"text":"shall cry"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H2199"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"wall","strongs":["H7023"]},{"text":", and the beam"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H3714"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"timber","strongs":["H6086"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"answer","strongs":["H6030"]},{"text":"it."}]},{"number":12,"text":"Woe to him that buildeth a town with blood, and stablisheth a city by iniquity!","tokens":[{"text":"Woe","strongs":["H1945"]},{"text":"to him that"},{"text":"buildeth","strongs":["H1129"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"town","strongs":["H5892"]},{"text":"with"},{"text":"blood","strongs":["H1818"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"stablisheth","strongs":["H3559"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"city","strongs":["H7151"]},{"text":"by"},{"text":"iniquity","strongs":["H5766"]},{"text":"!"}]},{"number":13,"text":"Behold, is it not of the LORD of hosts that the people shall labour in the very fire, and the people shall weary themselves for very vanity?","tokens":[{"text":"Behold, is it not of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"that the"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"labour","strongs":["H3021"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"very","strongs":["H1767"]},{"text":"fire","strongs":["H0784"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H3816"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"weary","strongs":["H3286"]},{"text":"themselves for"},{"text":"very","strongs":["H1767"]},{"text":"vanity","strongs":["H7385"]},{"text":"?"}]},{"number":14,"text":"For the earth shall be filled with the knowledge of the glory of the LORD, as the waters cover the sea.","tokens":[{"text":"For the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"filled","strongs":["H4390"]},{"text":"with the"},{"text":"knowledge","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"glory","strongs":["H3519"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", as the"},{"text":"waters","strongs":["H4325"]},{"text":"cover","strongs":["H3680"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":15,"text":"Woe unto him that giveth his neighbour drink, that puttest thy bottle to him, and makest him drunken also, that thou mayest look on their nakedness!","tokens":[{"text":"Woe","strongs":["H1945"]},{"text":"unto him that giveth his"},{"text":"neighbour","strongs":["H7453"]},{"text":"drink","strongs":["H8248"]},{"text":", that"},{"text":"puttest","strongs":["H5596"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"bottle","strongs":["H2573"]},{"text":"to him, and makest him"},{"text":"drunken","strongs":["H7937"]},{"text":"also, that thou mayest"},{"text":"look","strongs":["H5027"]},{"text":"on their"},{"text":"nakedness","strongs":["H4589"]},{"text":"!"}]},{"number":16,"text":"Thou art filled with shame for glory: drink thou also, and let thy foreskin be uncovered: the cup of the LORD’s right hand shall be turned unto thee, and shameful spewing shall be on thy glory.","tokens":[{"text":"Thou art"},{"text":"filled","strongs":["H7646"]},{"text":"with"},{"text":"shame","strongs":["H7036"]},{"text":"for"},{"text":"glory","strongs":["H3519"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"drink","strongs":["H8354"]},{"text":"thou also, and let thy foreskin be"},{"text":"uncovered","strongs":["H6188"]},{"text":": the"},{"text":"cup","strongs":["H3563"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD’s","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"right"},{"text":"hand","strongs":["H3225"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"turned","strongs":["H5437"]},{"text":"unto thee, and shameful"},{"text":"spewing","strongs":["H7022"]},{"text":"shall be on thy"},{"text":"glory","strongs":["H3519"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":17,"text":"For the violence of Lebanon shall cover thee, and the spoil of beasts, which made them afraid, because of men’s blood, and for the violence of the land, of the city, and of all that dwell therein.","tokens":[{"text":"For the"},{"text":"violence","strongs":["H2555"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Lebanon","strongs":["H3844"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"cover","strongs":["H3680"]},{"text":"thee, and the"},{"text":"spoil","strongs":["H7701"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"beasts","strongs":["H0929"]},{"text":", which made them"},{"text":"afraid","strongs":["H2865"]},{"text":", because of"},{"text":"men’s","strongs":["H0120"]},{"text":"blood","strongs":["H1818"]},{"text":", and for the"},{"text":"violence","strongs":["H2555"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":", of the"},{"text":"city","strongs":["H7151"]},{"text":", and of all that"},{"text":"dwell","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"therein."}]},{"number":18,"text":"What profiteth the graven image that the maker thereof hath graven it; the molten image, and a teacher of lies, that the maker of his work trusteth therein, to make dumb idols?","tokens":[{"text":"What"},{"text":"profiteth","strongs":["H3276"]},{"text":"the graven"},{"text":"image","strongs":["H6459"]},{"text":"that the"},{"text":"maker","strongs":["H3335"]},{"text":"thereof hath"},{"text":"graven","strongs":["H6458"]},{"text":"it; the molten"},{"text":"image","strongs":["H4541"]},{"text":", and a"},{"text":"teacher","strongs":["H3384"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"lies","strongs":["H8267"]},{"text":", that the"},{"text":"maker","strongs":["H3335"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"work","strongs":["H3336"]},{"text":"trusteth","strongs":["H0982"]},{"text":"therein, to"},{"text":"make","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"dumb","strongs":["H0483"]},{"text":"idols","strongs":["H0457"]},{"text":"?"}]},{"number":19,"text":"Woe unto him that saith to the wood, Awake; to the dumb stone, Arise, it shall teach! Behold, it is laid over with gold and silver, and there is no breath at all in the midst of it.","tokens":[{"text":"Woe","strongs":["H1945"]},{"text":"unto him that"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"to the"},{"text":"wood","strongs":["H6086"]},{"text":","},{"text":"Awake","strongs":["H6974"]},{"text":"; to the"},{"text":"dumb","strongs":["H1748"]},{"text":"stone","strongs":["H0068"]},{"text":","},{"text":"Arise","strongs":["H5782"]},{"text":", it shall"},{"text":"teach","strongs":["H3384"]},{"text":"! Behold, it is"},{"text":"laid","strongs":["H8610"]},{"text":"over with"},{"text":"gold","strongs":["H2091"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"silver","strongs":["H3701"]},{"text":", and there is no"},{"text":"breath","strongs":["H7307"]},{"text":"at all in the"},{"text":"midst","strongs":["H7130"]},{"text":"of it."}]},{"number":20,"text":"But the LORD is in his holy temple: let all the earth keep silence before him.","tokens":[{"text":"But the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"is in his"},{"text":"holy","strongs":["H6944"]},{"text":"temple","strongs":["H1964"]},{"text":": let all the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"keep"},{"text":"silence","strongs":["H2013"]},{"text":"before","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"him."}]}]},"3":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"A prayer of Habakkuk the prophet upon Shigionoth.","tokens":[{"text":"A"},{"text":"prayer","strongs":["H8605"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Habakkuk","strongs":["H2265"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"prophet","strongs":["H5030"]},{"text":"upon"},{"text":"Shigionoth","strongs":["H7692"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":2,"text":"O LORD, I have heard thy speech, and was afraid: O LORD, revive thy work in the midst of the years, in the midst of the years make known; in wrath remember mercy.","tokens":[{"text":"O"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", I have"},{"text":"heard","strongs":["H8085"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"speech","strongs":["H8088"]},{"text":", and was"},{"text":"afraid","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":": O"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":","},{"text":"revive","strongs":["H2421"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"work","strongs":["H6467"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"midst","strongs":["H7130"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"years","strongs":["H8141"]},{"text":", in the"},{"text":"midst","strongs":["H7130"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"years","strongs":["H8141"]},{"text":"make"},{"text":"known","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"; in"},{"text":"wrath","strongs":["H7267"]},{"text":"remember","strongs":["H2142"]},{"text":"mercy","strongs":["H7355"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"God came from Teman, and the Holy One from mount Paran. Selah. His glory covered the heavens, and the earth was full of his praise.","tokens":[{"text":"God","strongs":["H0433"]},{"text":"came","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"from"},{"text":"Teman","strongs":["H8487"]},{"text":", and the Holy"},{"text":"One","strongs":["H6918"]},{"text":"from"},{"text":"mount","strongs":["H2022"]},{"text":"Paran","strongs":["H6290"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Selah","strongs":["H5542"]},{"text":". His"},{"text":"glory","strongs":["H1935"]},{"text":"covered","strongs":["H3680"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"heavens","strongs":["H8064"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"was"},{"text":"full","strongs":["H4390"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"praise","strongs":["H8416"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"And his brightness was as the light; he had horns coming out of his hand: and there was the hiding of his power.","tokens":[{"text":"And his"},{"text":"brightness","strongs":["H5051"]},{"text":"was as the"},{"text":"light","strongs":["H0216"]},{"text":"; he had"},{"text":"horns","strongs":["H7161"]},{"text":"coming out of his"},{"text":"hand","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":": and there was the"},{"text":"hiding","strongs":["H2253"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"power","strongs":["H5797"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"Before him went the pestilence, and burning coals went forth at his feet.","tokens":[{"text":"Before","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"him"},{"text":"went","strongs":["H3212"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"pestilence","strongs":["H1698"]},{"text":", and burning"},{"text":"coals","strongs":["H7565"]},{"text":"went"},{"text":"forth","strongs":["H3318"]},{"text":"at his"},{"text":"feet","strongs":["H7272"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"He stood, and measured the earth: he beheld, and drove asunder the nations; and the everlasting mountains were scattered, the perpetual hills did bow: his ways are everlasting.","tokens":[{"text":"He"},{"text":"stood","strongs":["H5975"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"measured","strongs":["H4128"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":": he"},{"text":"beheld","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":", and drove"},{"text":"asunder","strongs":["H5425"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"nations","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"; and the"},{"text":"everlasting","strongs":["H5703"]},{"text":"mountains","strongs":["H2042"]},{"text":"were"},{"text":"scattered","strongs":["H6327"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"perpetual","strongs":["H5769"]},{"text":"hills","strongs":["H1389"]},{"text":"did"},{"text":"bow","strongs":["H7817"]},{"text":": his"},{"text":"ways","strongs":["H1979"]},{"text":"are"},{"text":"everlasting","strongs":["H5769"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":7,"text":"I saw the tents of Cushan in affliction: and the curtains of the land of Midian did tremble.","tokens":[{"text":"I"},{"text":"saw","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"tents","strongs":["H0168"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Cushan","strongs":["H3572"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"affliction","strongs":["H0205"]},{"text":": and the"},{"text":"curtains","strongs":["H3407"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Midian","strongs":["H4080"]},{"text":"did"},{"text":"tremble","strongs":["H7264"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"Was the LORD displeased against the rivers? was thine anger against the rivers? was thy wrath against the sea, that thou didst ride upon thine horses and thy chariots of salvation?","tokens":[{"text":"Was the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"displeased","strongs":["H2734"]},{"text":"against the"},{"text":"rivers","strongs":["H5104"]},{"text":"? was thine"},{"text":"anger","strongs":["H0639"]},{"text":"against the"},{"text":"rivers","strongs":["H5104"]},{"text":"? was thy"},{"text":"wrath","strongs":["H5678"]},{"text":"against the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":", that thou didst"},{"text":"ride","strongs":["H7392"]},{"text":"upon thine"},{"text":"horses","strongs":["H5483"]},{"text":"and thy"},{"text":"chariots","strongs":["H4818"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"salvation","strongs":["H3444"]},{"text":"?"}]},{"number":9,"text":"Thy bow was made quite naked, according to the oaths of the tribes, even thy word. Selah. Thou didst cleave the earth with rivers.","tokens":[{"text":"Thy"},{"text":"bow","strongs":["H7198"]},{"text":"was made"},{"text":"quite","strongs":["H6181"]},{"text":"naked","strongs":["H5783"]},{"text":", according to the"},{"text":"oaths","strongs":["H7621"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"tribes","strongs":["H4294"]},{"text":", even thy"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H0562"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Selah","strongs":["H5542"]},{"text":". Thou didst"},{"text":"cleave","strongs":["H1234"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"earth","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"with"},{"text":"rivers","strongs":["H5104"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"The mountains saw thee, and they trembled: the overflowing of the water passed by: the deep uttered his voice, and lifted up his hands on high.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"mountains","strongs":["H2022"]},{"text":"saw","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"thee, and they"},{"text":"trembled","strongs":["H2342"]},{"text":": the"},{"text":"overflowing","strongs":["H2230"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"water","strongs":["H4325"]},{"text":"passed"},{"text":"by","strongs":["H5674"]},{"text":": the"},{"text":"deep","strongs":["H8415"]},{"text":"uttered","strongs":["H5414"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"voice","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":", and lifted"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"hands","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"on"},{"text":"high","strongs":["H7315"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":11,"text":"The sun and moon stood still in their habitation: at the light of thine arrows they went, and at the shining of thy glittering spear.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"sun","strongs":["H8121"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"moon","strongs":["H3394"]},{"text":"stood"},{"text":"still","strongs":["H5975"]},{"text":"in their"},{"text":"habitation","strongs":["H2073"]},{"text":": at the"},{"text":"light","strongs":["H0216"]},{"text":"of thine"},{"text":"arrows","strongs":["H2671"]},{"text":"they"},{"text":"went","strongs":["H1980"]},{"text":", and at the"},{"text":"shining","strongs":["H5051"]},{"text":"of thy"},{"text":"glittering","strongs":["H1300"]},{"text":"spear","strongs":["H2595"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"Thou didst march through the land in indignation, thou didst thresh the heathen in anger.","tokens":[{"text":"Thou didst march"},{"text":"through","strongs":["H6805"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"indignation","strongs":["H2195"]},{"text":", thou didst"},{"text":"thresh","strongs":["H1758"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"heathen","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"anger","strongs":["H0639"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"Thou wentest forth for the salvation of thy people, even for salvation with thine anointed; thou woundedst the head out of the house of the wicked, by discovering the foundation unto the neck. Selah.","tokens":[{"text":"Thou wentest"},{"text":"forth","strongs":["H3318"]},{"text":"for the"},{"text":"salvation","strongs":["H3468"]},{"text":"of thy"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":", even for"},{"text":"salvation","strongs":["H3468"]},{"text":"with thine"},{"text":"anointed","strongs":["H4899"]},{"text":"; thou"},{"text":"woundedst","strongs":["H4272"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"head","strongs":["H7218"]},{"text":"out of the"},{"text":"house","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"wicked","strongs":["H7563"]},{"text":", by"},{"text":"discovering","strongs":["H6168"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"foundation","strongs":["H3247"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"neck","strongs":["H6677"]},{"text":"."},{"text":"Selah","strongs":["H5542"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":14,"text":"Thou didst strike through with his staves the head of his villages: they came out as a whirlwind to scatter me: their rejoicing was as to devour the poor secretly.","tokens":[{"text":"Thou didst strike"},{"text":"through","strongs":["H5344"]},{"text":"with his"},{"text":"staves","strongs":["H4294"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"head","strongs":["H7218"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"villages","strongs":["H6518"]},{"text":": they came out as a"},{"text":"whirlwind","strongs":["H5590"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"scatter","strongs":["H6327"]},{"text":"me: their"},{"text":"rejoicing","strongs":["H5951"]},{"text":"was as to"},{"text":"devour","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"poor","strongs":["H6041"]},{"text":"secretly","strongs":["H4565"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":15,"text":"Thou didst walk through the sea with thine horses, through the heap of great waters.","tokens":[{"text":"Thou didst"},{"text":"walk","strongs":["H1869"]},{"text":"through the"},{"text":"sea","strongs":["H3220"]},{"text":"with thine"},{"text":"horses","strongs":["H5483"]},{"text":", through the"},{"text":"heap","strongs":["H2563"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H7227"]},{"text":"waters","strongs":["H4325"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":16,"text":"When I heard, my belly trembled; my lips quivered at the voice: rottenness entered into my bones, and I trembled in myself, that I might rest in the day of trouble: when he cometh up unto the people, he will invade them with his troops.","tokens":[{"text":"When I"},{"text":"heard","strongs":["H8085"]},{"text":", my"},{"text":"belly","strongs":["H0990"]},{"text":"trembled","strongs":["H7264"]},{"text":"; my"},{"text":"lips","strongs":["H8193"]},{"text":"quivered","strongs":["H6750"]},{"text":"at the"},{"text":"voice","strongs":["H6963"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"rottenness","strongs":["H7538"]},{"text":"entered","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"into my"},{"text":"bones","strongs":["H6106"]},{"text":", and I"},{"text":"trembled","strongs":["H7264"]},{"text":"in myself, that I might"},{"text":"rest","strongs":["H5117"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"trouble","strongs":["H6869"]},{"text":": when he cometh"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H5927"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":", he will invade them with his"},{"text":"troops","strongs":["H1464"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":17,"text":"Although the fig tree shall not blossom, neither shall fruit be in the vines; the labour of the olive shall fail, and the fields shall yield no meat; the flock shall be cut off from the fold, and there shall be no herd in the stalls:","tokens":[{"text":"Although the fig"},{"text":"tree","strongs":["H8384"]},{"text":"shall not"},{"text":"blossom","strongs":["H6524"]},{"text":", neither shall"},{"text":"fruit","strongs":["H2981"]},{"text":"be in the"},{"text":"vines","strongs":["H1612"]},{"text":"; the"},{"text":"labour","strongs":["H4639"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"olive","strongs":["H2132"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"fail","strongs":["H3584"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"fields","strongs":["H7709"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"yield","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"no"},{"text":"meat","strongs":["H0400"]},{"text":"; the"},{"text":"flock","strongs":["H6629"]},{"text":"shall be cut"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H1504"]},{"text":"from the"},{"text":"fold","strongs":["H4356"]},{"text":", and there shall be no"},{"text":"herd","strongs":["H1241"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"stalls","strongs":["H7517"]},{"text":":"}]},{"number":18,"text":"Yet I will rejoice in the LORD, I will joy in the God of my salvation.","tokens":[{"text":"Yet I will"},{"text":"rejoice","strongs":["H5937"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", I will"},{"text":"joy","strongs":["H1523"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"of my"},{"text":"salvation","strongs":["H3468"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":19,"text":"The LORD God is my strength, and he will make my feet like hinds’ feet, and he will make me to walk upon mine high places. To the chief singer on my stringed instruments.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3069"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0136"]},{"text":"is my"},{"text":"strength","strongs":["H2428"]},{"text":", and he will"},{"text":"make","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"feet","strongs":["H7272"]},{"text":"like"},{"text":"hinds’","strongs":["H0355"]},{"text":"feet, and he will make me to"},{"text":"walk","strongs":["H1869"]},{"text":"upon mine high"},{"text":"places","strongs":["H1116"]},{"text":". To the chief"},{"text":"singer","strongs":["H5329"]},{"text":"on my stringed"},{"text":"instruments","strongs":["H5058"]},{"text":"."}]}]}}}